  "instructions": "Wrap the two payment SDKs (`libraries/`, provided) behind `PaymentGatewayAdapter`. Implement `PaytmPaymentGatewayAdapter` and `RazorpayPaymentGatewayAdapter` in `adapters/` (call the SDK with its own method and field names, map the string status to `PaymentStatus`, return a domain `Payment`), `PaymentServiceImpl.make_payment` in `services/payment_service_impl.py` (raise `InvalidBillException(\"Invalid bill id\")`, otherwise charge `bill.get_amount_to_be_paid()` through the injected adapter) and `PaymentController.make_payment` in `controllers/payment_controller.py` (catch only `InvalidBillException`).",
